lor="gray">oldest &gt;&gt;</FONT></TD><TD BORDER='0'></TD><TD title="portage://kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5" href="../kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5-merge.svg">--merge&nbsp;</TD><TD title="portage://kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5" href="../kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5-fetchonly.svg">--fetchonly&nbsp;</TD><TD title="portage://kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5" href="../kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5-info.svg">--<u>info</u>&nbsp;</TD><TD BORDER='0'></TD><TD title="portage://kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5" href="../kde-plasma/plasma-firewall-6.4.5-emerge.svg">emerge</TD></TR></TABLE>>];

